Word packs
----------
Per-language licenses and attribution ship in each pack JSON
(`public/packs/<lang>/<cefr>.json`) and on the in-app About page.
License bands (ADR 0029):

  EN A1–B2 — CC0-1.0 / CEFR-J citation (Tono Lab). B2 lemmas are selected
  from the CEFR-J Vocabulary Profile; not a verbatim dump.
  EN C1–C2 — CC-BY-SA-4.0 Octanove Vocabulary Profile (olp-en-cefrj).

  DE/ES A1–B1 — CC0-1.0 curated learner lemmas.
  DE/ES B2–C2 — CC-BY-SA-4.0 wordhoard v0.1.0 full dataset; frequency-rank
  bands, not Goethe or Instituto Cervantes lists.

  PT A1–C2 — CC-BY-SA-4.0 (Wiktionary-derived / OpenSubtitles frequency,
  ADR 0009). C-levels are frequency slices, not CAPLE.

Gloss and synonym copy is original to Hiato. Frequency selection also draws
on hermitdave/FrequencyWords (MIT). Packs are curated learner lists, not
verbatim dumps of any proprietary wordlist (ADR 0026). Pack JSON stays under
the `license` field inside each file (CC0-1.0 or CC-BY-SA-4.0). Share-alike
applies to the redistributed CC-BY-SA lemma lists.

Derived source caches (not the PWA bundle)
------------------------------------------
These committed files adapt third-party datasets and stay under those terms
(ADR 0029, scripts/data/README.md):

  scripts/data/en-easiest-cefr.json — easiest-tag merge of the CEFR-J
  Vocabulary Profile (cite Tono Lab) and the Octanove Vocabulary Profile
  (CC-BY-SA-4.0).
  scripts/data/hint-stem-cache.json — surface-to-lemma stems from wordhoard
  v0.1.0 (CC-BY-SA-4.0) plus regular affix replay. Not a copy of the
  Hunspell dictionaries.

Build-time spellcheck (not shipped)
-----------------------------------
Pack expansion and `packs:check` use `nspell` with Hunspell dictionaries
installed as **devDependencies**. They are language-membership filters at
build time only — the `.aff`/`.dic` files are not copied into the PWA
bundle or Workbox `includeAssets`.

  nspell — MIT
  dictionary-en (SCOWL) — MIT AND BSD
  dictionary-de (igerman98) — GPL-2.0 OR GPL-3.0
  dictionary-es (RLA-ES) — GPL-3.0 OR LGPL-3.0 OR MPL-1.1
  dictionary-pt — LGPL-3.0 OR MPL-2.0
  dictionary-pt-pt (Natura) — GPL-2.0 OR LGPL-2.1 OR MPL-1.1

